---
name: puppet
alias: 傀儡术
brief: "Task execution channel: file ops, coding, queries, scheduling"
description: "唯一任务执行通道。将所有需要实际操作的任务（文件操作、代码编写执行、信息查询、消息发送、日程管理、天气查询、语音控制等）委派给专业的傀儡Agent执行。同时支持任务管理：查询列表、查看进度、取消任务、重试任务"
keywords:
  - 任务
  - 执行
  - 文件
  - 代码
  - 查询
  - 日程
  - puppet
  - task
  - execute
  - file
  - code
when_to_use: "When user wants to perform any actual task: file ops, coding, queries, scheduling, messaging, etc."
parameters:
  - name: task
    type: string
    description: "任务描述"
    required: true
  - name: action_type
    type: string
    description: "execute/list/progress/cancel/retry"
    required: false
    default: execute
  - name: context
    type: string
    description: "任务上下文"
    required: false
  - name: callback_preference
    type: string
    description: "report_warm/report_simple/celebrate/discuss/silent"
    required: false
    default: report_warm
executor: builtin:puppet
---
